['-p', 'Use the `omg-probe-standalone-html` skill and follow its procedure exactly, then render the note below into `design.html` — a standalone single-file HTML page — in the current working directory.\n\n# Job runner scheduling\n\nA small local job runner executes short-lived jobs submitted from a CLI. Jobs are\nIO-bound, arrive in bursts, and must not outlive the process that started them.\nDecision: a worker pool, bounded to NCPU-2 workers.\n', '--output-format', 'json', '--permission-mode', 'dontAsk', '--plugin-dir', '/tmp/omg-lift-exclusion/run/skills-plugin', '--session-id', '29fb274c-18fc-4080-ad8c-d15233458c3d']
